# A round garden bush, to show off the cel shading on curves.
size 17 13 17
voxel 0.06
smooth 2
colors
  l leaf
  h leafLight
ellipsoid 8 5 8 7.5 5 7.5 l
ellipsoid 5 8 6 4 3.5 4 l
ellipsoid 11 7.5 10 4 3.5 4 l
ellipsoid 9 9 5 3.5 3 3.5 l
# Sunlit tufts on top.
ellipsoid 5 10.5 6 2.5 1.2 2.5 h
ellipsoid 11 10 10 2.5 1.2 2.5 h
ellipsoid 9 11.2 5 2 1 2 h
